This folder contains anonymised STL files generated from the MRI-based segmentation of a representative knee included in the study.

The model comprises the femur and tibia together with their corresponding articular cartilage structures. Separate STL files are provided for the bony anatomy and cartilage components to allow independent visualisation and 3D printing.

The files include:
- Femur
- Tibia
- Femoral cartilage
- Tibial cartilage

All files are anonymised and contain no participant-identifying information. The models are provided as supplementary material to illustrate the anatomical segmentation and 3D-printing workflow used in the dissertation.
